\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid6838241\charrsid6838241 How does drafting help a writer in refining a piece of writing? }{\f1\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4478570 
\par By this writer convert all his experiences in written form so when he start writing he follow the incidents and facts in proper way, so the possibility get reduce that might be while writing he can miss the point. In this way 
it will help writer to refine his piece of writing. 
